    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/30e6ac1ee7216355dae17dbf796f5c80.webp?t=1749151511\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/374e3ba743cb3bab387253906ecaa01e.poster.avif?t=1749151511\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/374e3ba743cb3bab387253906ecaa01e.webm?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/374e3ba743cb3bab387253906ecaa01e.mp4?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Have A Delivery</strong> is a stylized, fast-paced FPS action game. Inspired by the humor of <i>Men in Black</i> and Jackie Chan films, this over-the-top adventure challenges you to eliminate the mafia that has seized control of New York in a single night. Because your codename is too long, everyone simply calls you \u201cAgent\u201d as you go building by building, taking down dangerous mafia bosses. Can you deliver it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/9295cf21803a5739eff1567180e8f8aa.webp?t=1749151511\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/0e6a687b11d61575e168323b4f4136f4.poster.avif?t=1749151511\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/0e6a687b11d61575e168323b4f4136f4.webm?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/0e6a687b11d61575e168323b4f4136f4.mp4?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over obstacles, run on walls, perform aerial flips, and swoop down on enemies using your grappling hook. Unlock new weapons to experiment with different strategies, rip your foes apart, and conquer each stage at record speed. Climb the leaderboards as you rack up high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/d2dc1ae1a94b2b72ae5b689c65932bf5.webp?t=1749151511\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Parkour System:</strong> Swiftly navigate mafia warehouses with wall-runs, quick dashes, and a grappling hook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Mix and match ranged and melee weapons\u2014like pistols and axes\u2014to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Based Gameplay:</strong> Chain uninterrupted parkour moves and stylish kills to earn bigger rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafia Boss Showdowns:</strong> Face off against uniquely themed bosses, each sporting distinct fighting styles and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System:</strong> Level up to unlock perks and mutators, customizing your approach and unleashing your full potential.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/30e6ac1ee7216355dae17dbf796f5c80.webp?t=1749151511\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/374e3ba743cb3bab387253906ecaa01e.poster.avif?t=1749151511\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/374e3ba743cb3bab387253906ecaa01e.webm?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/374e3ba743cb3bab387253906ecaa01e.mp4?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Have A Delivery</strong> is a stylized, fast-paced FPS action game. Inspired by the humor of <i>Men in Black</i> and Jackie Chan films, this over-the-top adventure challenges you to eliminate the mafia that has seized control of New York in a single night. Because your codename is too long, everyone simply calls you \u201cAgent\u201d as you go building by building, taking down dangerous mafia bosses. Can you deliver it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/9295cf21803a5739eff1567180e8f8aa.webp?t=1749151511\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/0e6a687b11d61575e168323b4f4136f4.poster.avif?t=1749151511\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/0e6a687b11d61575e168323b4f4136f4.webm?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/0e6a687b11d61575e168323b4f4136f4.mp4?t=1749151511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over obstacles, run on walls, perform aerial flips, and swoop down on enemies using your grappling hook. Unlock new weapons to experiment with different strategies, rip your foes apart, and conquer each stage at record speed. Climb the leaderboards as you rack up high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420980/extras/d2dc1ae1a94b2b72ae5b689c65932bf5.webp?t=1749151511\" width=600 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Parkour System:</strong> Swiftly navigate mafia warehouses with wall-runs, quick dashes, and a grappling hook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Mix and match ranged and melee weapons\u2014like pistols and axes\u2014to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-Based Gameplay:</strong> Chain uninterrupted parkour moves and stylish kills to earn bigger rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafia Boss Showdowns:</strong> Face off against uniquely themed bosses, each sporting distinct fighting styles and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System:</strong> Level up to unlock perks and mutators, customizing your approach and unleashing your full potential.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You Have A Delivery is a stylized, fast-paced FPS action game, inspired by action-comedy films. Take down the mafia in one night: rip apart your enemies, unlock guns and perks, and deliver unstoppable chaos. You're the only one who can pull it off. Can you deliver it?",
